    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but living authentically is exactly what's causing the shame. every mistake i make, every time i fail, it feels like i'm actively tearing down their reputation. it's not just about me being sad... it's that by staying, i'm just making the legacy worse. if i could just... erase the damage, maybe they could finally be respected again without me dragging them down.",
